exports[`parseMarkdown hast snapshots > frontmatter/malformed-frontmatter.md renders stable hast 1`] = `
"<h1 id="user-content-malformed-frontmatter" data-line-start="11" data-line-end="11">Malformed Frontmatter</h1>
<p data-line-start="13" data-line-end="16">The YAML above is deliberately broken: an unclosed flow sequence, a key with no
colon, doubled colons, and inconsistent indentation. A robust ingest should
recover — surface a metadata-parse warning, keep <code>title</code> if it can, and still
render the body — rather than dropping the whole document.</p>
