<p data-line-start="8" data-line-end="9">These wiki-links point at notes that do not exist and must resolve to dangling
stubs, not crashes:</p>
<ul data-line-start="11" data-line-end="15">
<li><wiki-link class="wikilink" data-wikilink="true" data-target="ghost-node">ghost-node</wiki-link></li>
<li><wiki-link class="wikilink" data-wikilink="true" data-target="node-that-was-deleted">node-that-was-deleted</wiki-link></li>
