<li><wiki-link class="wikilink" data-wikilink="true" data-target="node-storage" data-heading="Nonexistent Heading">node-storage#Nonexistent Heading</wiki-link></li>
<li><wiki-link class="wikilink" data-wikilink="true" data-target="" data-label="empty target">empty target</wiki-link></li>
</ul>
<p data-line-start="17" data-line-end="18">A broken relative markdown link too:
<a href="../projects/does-not-exist.md">missing file</a>.</p>
